# {name}

The rules every agent (Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode) follows in {name}; the global ones are in `~/AGENTS.md`.

- Read [INTENT.md](INTENT.md) and [GLOSSARY.md](GLOSSARY.md) first; the hal way is in [README.md](README.md).
- Every piece of work has a numbered plan in `plans/`; commit heads are `<type>(<NNNN>|<step>): <what>`.
- Work in a field (`~/.hal/git/worktree/{name}/<NN>`), never plan work in the farmer's field `farmer-{name}`.
- Secrets only by `hal2-cli-secrets set` from a field, never plaintext in a commit.
